<div class="ei-returns">

  <div class="ei-returns__hero">
    <p class="ei-returns__eyebrow">Customer Care</p>
    <h1 class="ei-returns__headline">Returns & Refunds</h1>
    <p class="ei-returns__subline">We want you to love every piece. If something isn't right, we're here to help.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ei-returns__meta-bar">
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">14</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Days to return</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">5</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Business days for refund</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">No</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Restocking fee</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">Original</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Payment method</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ei-returns__body">

    <div class="ei-returns__section">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Overview</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">Our return policy</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">We accept returns within 14 days of the delivery date. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in their original condition with all tags, boxes, and dustbags attached. All returns are subject to inspection before a refund is approved.</p>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">Please note that return shipping costs are covered by Elara Ivy Co. only in the case of a damaged or incorrect item. For change-of-mind returns, the customer is responsible for the cost of return shipping.</p>
      <div class="ei-returns__notice">
        <p>Returns must be shipped using <strong>UPS, FedEx, or DHL only.</strong> Returns sent via regular postal services will not be accepted and will be declined without refund.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--alt">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Eligibility</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">What can be returned</h2>
      <div class="ei-returns__two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="ei-returns__col-title ei-returns__col-title--yes">Eligible for return</p>
          <ul class="ei-returns__list ei-returns__list--yes">
            <li>Unworn clothing with all original tags attached</li>
            <li>Unworn footwear in original box</li>
            <li>Unused accessories in original packaging</li>
            <li>Items in perfect original condition with dustbag where applicable</li>
            <li>Damaged or incorrectly shipped items (free return shipping)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="ei-returns__col-title ei-returns__col-title--no">Not eligible for return</p>
          <ul class="ei-returns__list ei-returns__list--no">
            <li>Worn, washed, or altered items</li>
            <li>Swimwear and lingerie (hygiene policy)</li>
            <li>Pierced jewellery</li>
            <li>Items marked as final sale</li>
            <li>Pre-owned or preloved items</li>
            <li>Items without original tags, box, or packaging</li>
            <li>Returns shipped after the 14-day window</li>
            <li>Returns sent via regular postal services</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Process</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">How to return an item</h2>
      <div class="ei-returns__steps">
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">01</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Submit a return request</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Email <a href="mailto:shop@elaraivyco.com">shop@elaraivyco.com</a> within 14 days of receiving your order. Include your order number and reason for return. We will respond within 1–2 business days with your return authorisation and instructions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">02</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Package your return</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Securely pack the item in its original packaging with all tags, boxes, and dustbags included. Include your order number inside the package. Items must be in perfect original condition — used or worn items will not be refunded.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">03</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Ship via UPS, FedEx, or DHL</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Ship your return using UPS, FedEx, or DHL only — returns sent via regular postal services will be declined. For damaged or incorrect items, a prepaid return label will be provided. For change-of-mind returns, you are responsible for the return shipping cost. Keep your tracking receipt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">04</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Receive your refund</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Once we receive and inspect your return, your refund will be processed within 5 business days to your original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email once your refund has been approved.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--alt">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Exchanges</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">Need a different size or colour?</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">We process exchanges as a return and new order. To exchange an item, place a new order for the size or colour you need, then submit a return request for your original item. This guarantees your new size is reserved and ensures the fastest processing time.</p>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">If you have concerns about availability before returning, please contact us and we will do our best to assist.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Damaged or incorrect items</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">Something not right?</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, please contact us at <a href="mailto:shop@elaraivyco.com" class="ei-returns__link">shop@elaraivyco.com</a> immediately with your order number and photos of the issue. We will arrange a free return and full refund or replacement as quickly as possible.</p>
      <div class="ei-returns__notice ei-returns__notice--info">
        <p>Please note that a return label for damaged or incorrect items will only be provided after we have confirmed the issue. Do not ship the item back before receiving your return authorisation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--navy">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow ei-returns__section-eyebrow--light">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title ei-returns__section-title--light">We're here to help</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text ei-returns__text--light">Our team is happy to assist with any questions about your return or refund. Please have your order number ready when you reach out.</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="ei-returns__cta">Contact us</a>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .ei-returns {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    color: #0D1B3E;
  }

  .ei-returns__hero {
    background-color: #0D1B3E;
    padding: 64px 48px 56px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ei-returns__eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #CFAE70;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ei-returns__headline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ei-returns__subline {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-bar {
    background: #F5F3F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E4DF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 28px 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #888;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #D8D4CE;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ei-returns__body {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ei-returns__section {
    padding: 56px 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #EDE9E4;
  }

  .ei-returns__section--alt {
    background: #FAFAF8;
  }

  .ei-returns__section--navy {
    background: #0D1B3E;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #CFAE70;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-eyebrow--light {
    color: rgba(207,174,112,0.8);
  }

  .ei-returns__section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-title--light {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ei-returns__text {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .ei-returns__text--light {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .ei-returns__link {
    color: #6E73B8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ei-returns__notice {
    background: #FEF9EE;
    border-left: 3px solid #CFAE70;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .ei-returns__notice--info {
    background: #EEF1FB;
    border-left-color: #6E73B8;
  }

  .ei-returns__notice strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0D1B3E;
  }

  .ei-returns__two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title--yes {
    color: #1A6B1A;
    border-color: #1A6B1A;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title--no {
    color: #993C1D;
    border-color: #993C1D;
  }

  .ei-returns__list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .ei-returns__list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #444;
    padding-left: 22px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .ei-returns__list--yes li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #1A6B1A;
    font-size: 12px;
    top: 1px;
  }

  .ei-returns__list--no li::before {
    content: '✕';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #993C1D;
    font-size: 12px;
    top: 1px;
  }

  .ei-returns__steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #EDE9E4;
  }

  .ei-returns__step:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #CFAE70;
    min-width: 40px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text a {
    color: #6E73B8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ei-returns__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    background: #CFAE70;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .ei-returns__cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ei-returns__hero { padding: 48px 24px 40px; }
    .ei-returns__section { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-bar { padding: 20px 24px; gap: 16px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-item { padding: 0 16px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-divider { display: none; }
    .ei-returns__two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Returns Policy",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Returns Policy" }]
}
{% endschema %}

